  "summary_en": "Austrade's AI transparency statement under the Australian Government's responsible AI policy. It sets out use of Microsoft 365 Copilot and social media monitoring tools, mandatory staff training, accountable officials, human supervision, an AI register and an AI Working Group. It has no physical or robotic content.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Applies the OECD definition of AI per the Digital Transformation Agency's responsible AI policy",
   "Staff must complete AI Foundations training and acknowledge the AI tools policy before using generative AI",
   "Staff are accountable for AI outputs, must verify them and disclose AI use in client or public material",
   "Head of Digital Products and Platforms is the Accountable Official ensuring human supervision and impact assessment",
   "Proposed AI solutions require AI Working Group review, adherence to Australia's AI Ethics Principles and security risk plans"
